title: Refresh compatible 2026-07-26 dependency updates with engine-aware deferrals
description: "Upgrade compatible current dependencies and record explicit compatibility dispositions for majors whose engine or migration requirements exceed the supported baseline. Validate build, coverage, security, installed package, and release gates."
