acceptance_criteria: "@sentry/node is updated to the latest compatible release; TOON 4, TypeScript 7, and npm-package-arg 14 are either upgraded with full compatibility proof or explicitly deferred to canonical migration lineage with engine evidence; pnpm audit reports zero vulnerabilities; lockfile, docs if needed, and release gates remain green"
