confidence: high
resolution: "No 2026-07-26 dependency candidate was safely adoptable: Sentry 10.68.0 breaks packed strict-TypeScript consumers; TOON 4 requires canonical codec/storage proof in pm-5cgm2z; TypeScript 7 remains upstream/tooling-gated in pm-do5b; npm-package-arg 14 exceeds the supported Node 22 floor and is owned by pm-ksr40d."
expected_result: Refresh compatible dependencies without breaking source or installed consumers.
actual_result: "pnpm audit is clean and the proven dependency set remains unchanged. Sentry 10.68.0 was rejected by the packed strict consumer; TOON 4.0.0 (no declared engine floor) was deferred for lossless storage compatibility; TypeScript 7.1 dev was deferred for typescript-eslint and compiler-API migration; npm-package-arg 14.0.0 was deferred because it requires Node ^22.22.2, ^24.15.0, or >=26 while pm supports >=22.18.0."
