comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-26T06:25:21.969Z","harness:codex","text=Duplicate check evidence: all-status search found closed pm-tll8 for the previous dependency refresh and open pm-do5b for TypeScript 7 migration, but no current 2026-07-26 refresh item. Live pnpm outdated: @sentry/node 10.67.0->10.68.0 compatible with Node >=18; @toon-format/toon 4 requires Node ^22.22.2 or ^24.15.0 or >=26; npm-package-arg 14 and TypeScript 7 require separate compatibility/migration proof. Dependabot alerts and npm audit are empty."
  "2026-07-26T07:24:36.333Z","harness:codex","Dependency assessment: npm audit is clean, but @sentry/node 10.68.0 makes a freshly packed strict TypeScript consumer fail because published @apm-js-collab/code-transformer-bundler-plugins declarations reference missing instrumentation-serde modules. Retained proven 10.67.0; packed npx smoke passes."
  "2026-07-26T08:02:13.933Z","harness:codex","PR evidence: the Sentry 10.68.0 compatibility rejection and retained 10.67.0 consumer proof are documented in broad PR #734 head 185693b9; the canceled item remains terminal."
  "2026-07-26T08:29:26.779Z","harness:codex","Review disposition: canonical owners and live metadata are now explicit. TOON 4.0.0 declares no engine floor and is deferred to pm-5cgm2z for storage/codec compatibility; TypeScript 7.1 dev supports Node >=16.20 but remains blocked by typescript-eslint and the classic compiler API under pm-do5b; npm-package-arg 14 requires ^22.22.2, ^24.15.0, or >=26 and is deferred to pm-ksr40d because pm promises >=22.18.0. The linked smoke command reproduces both packed npx execution and the strict TypeScript SDK consumer."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-26T07:24:37.015Z","harness:codex",A semver-compatible dependency update is not releasable until the packed strict TypeScript consumer compiles; source tests alone do not expose broken published declaration graphs.
